WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.284
Keating is a teacher for the age of answering machines.

00:00:04.334 --> 00:00:06.764
It doesn't hand you the mountain.

00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:08.618
It teaches you to climb.

00:00:09.118 --> 00:00:16.322
It starts by asking how you learn: how much to ask before it tells, and what to do when you're stuck.

00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:21.854
It remembers who you are, the languages you speak, and what you're working toward.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:28.012
When it looks something up, it shows its sources, so you can check the claim yourself.

00:00:28.512 --> 00:00:30.999
Ideas become things you can move.

00:00:31.049 --> 00:00:34.663
Change a rate, and watch the curve answer back.

00:00:35.163 --> 00:00:42.092
Learning leaves the screen: go out, gather evidence, and bring back what surprised you.

00:00:42.592 --> 00:00:44.613
Recall is spoken and timed.

00:00:44.663 --> 00:00:47.194
Say it before the clock runs out.

00:00:47.694 --> 00:00:53.006
A new language gets built word by word, in an order you have to find.

00:00:53.506 --> 00:00:58.196
And when you're ready, sit a real exam, graded question by question.

00:00:58.696 --> 00:01:02.981
Keating runs in your browser or on your own machine.

00:01:03.031 --> 00:01:06.649
The future should not make students smaller.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.700
Keating helps them grow.
